  "legalLastUpdated": "Last updated: November 2026",
  "privacyOneLineTitle": "In one sentence",
  "privacyOneLineBody": "HENG is a local-first finance app: no sign-in, no network, and none of your ledger data is uploaded. Text recognition, voice recognition, and insights all run on your iPhone.",
  "privacyNotCollectedTitle": "What we don't collect",
  "privacyNotCollectedBody": "The developer does not collect, store, or transmit any of your personal information or ledger data. The app has no accounts and includes no third-party analytics, advertising, push, or social login SDKs. That is why the App Store privacy label says “Data Not Collected.”",
  "privacyStorageTitle": "Where your data lives",
  "privacyStorageBody": "Entries, budgets, and preferences are stored only in the app's sandboxed database on this device. Unless you explicitly export and share them from Settings → Data, this data never leaves your device.",
  "privacyCameraTitle": "Camera and photos",
  "privacyCameraBody": "When you scan a receipt, the app takes one image via the system camera or photo library and extracts text on-device using iOS Vision. The original image is never saved to your library or uploaded, and is released from memory once recognition finishes.",
  "privacyMicTitle": "Microphone and speech",
  "privacyMicBody": "Voice entry uses iOS speech recognition and requires on-device recognition. Audio is never written to disk or uploaded. If the system can't recognize speech on-device, the feature reports that it is temporarily unavailable rather than falling back to the cloud.",
  "privacyExportDeleteTitle": "Export and deletion",
  "privacyExportDeleteBody": "You can export a CSV sheet or JSON backup from Settings → Data and keep or share the file yourself; you can also delete all entries at once with Settings → Clear all entries. Uninstalling the app deletes all data stored on this device, so export a backup first.",
  "privacyPermissionsTitle": "Permissions",
  "privacyPermissionsBody": "Camera, photos, microphone, and speech recognition permissions are all optional and requested only when the matching feature is used. If you decline them, manual entry, reports, budgets, and export still work normally.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "Children's privacy",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "The app collects no user data and contains no ads or third-party tracking, so it is suitable for all users, including minors; we do not target children with tailored content.",
  "privacyUpdatesTitle": "Policy updates",
  "privacyUpdatesBody": "If a future version changes how data is handled, we will update this page in the app and adjust the App Store privacy label accordingly.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact us",
  "privacyContactBody": "If you have questions about this policy, contact us through the “App Support” link on the App Store product page.",
  "termsServiceTitle": "About the service",
  "termsServiceBody": "HENG is a free, local-first personal finance tool offering manual entry, receipt scanning, voice entry, income and expense reports, budget reminders, and data export. All features run on this device.",
  "termsNoticeTitle": "Using the app",
  "termsNoticeBody": "You are responsible for the accuracy of what you enter. Receipt and voice recognition may make mistakes due to blurry receipts, accents, or background noise, so check before saving. We recommend exporting a JSON backup regularly.",
  "termsFreeTitle": "Free, no in-app purchases",
  "termsFreeBody": "The current version is free: no subscriptions, no in-app purchases, no ads. If pricing changes in the future, we will explain it in the app in advance and it will not affect data already stored on your device.",
  "termsBackupTitle": "Data and backups",
  "termsBackupBody": "Your data is stored only on this device; the developer cannot access it or restore it for you. To the extent permitted by applicable law, you are responsible for data loss caused by a lost device, system failure, uninstalling the app, or clearing data yourself. You can export a backup from Settings at any time.",
  "termsDisclaimerTitle": "Disclaimer",
  "termsDisclaimerBody": "Statistics, budget reminders, and “Insights” in the app are generated from on-device data using fixed rules. They are for personal record-keeping reference only and are not investment, financial, tax, legal, or medical advice. You bear the risk of any decision you make based on the app's content.",
  "termsIpTitle": "Intellectual property",
  "termsIpBody": "The app's interface, icons, copy, and code belong to the developer. You may use exported personal ledger data for personal purposes, but not in ways that infringe the rights of others.",
  "termsChangesTitle": "Changes and termination",
  "termsChangesBody": "We may adjust or improve features with system updates. If maintenance ends in the future, we will announce it in the app in advance; you can still use your local data and export a backup at any time.",
  "termsLawTitle": "Governing law",
  "termsLawBody": "This agreement is governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. Any dispute arising from it should first be resolved through friendly negotiation.",
  "termsContactTitle": "Contact us",
